"MutableDirectedGraph"}]},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","kind":"symbol","title":"DirectedGraph","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A directed graph: a finite set of vertices and a finite collection of directed edges between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedGraph","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DirectedGraph","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/MutableDirectedGraph/insert(_:)":{"type":"topic","required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/MutableDirectedGraph\/insert(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"insert"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> (inserted"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", memberAfterInsert"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/mutabledirectedgraph\/insert(_:)","kind":"symbol","title":"insert(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inserts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" with no edges, if it is not already a vertex."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/MutableDirectedGraph/init()":{"type":"topic","id